#: .\podcasts\templates\podcasts\signup.html:214
#: .\podcasts\templates\socialaccount\signup.html:115
msgid ""
"To keep our services free and advertisement-free, Muse Podcast, LLC may sell"
" aggregated, anonymized data analytics to podcast creators, business "
"partners, or other third parties. We ensure your privacy by anonymizing "
"data, meaning your personal identifiable information (like your name or "
"exact contact details) will never be sold or shared. Your identity is "
"replaced by a unique, randomized number to maintain your anonymity."
msgstr ""
"हमारी सेवाओं को मुफ्त और विज्ञापन मुक्त रखने के लिए, म्यूज़ पॉडकास्ट, एलएलसी"
" पॉडकास्ट रचनाकारों, व्यापार भागीदारों या अन्य तृतीय पक्षों को संकलित, "
"गुमनाम डेटा एनालिटिक्स बेच सकता है। हम डेटा को गुमनाम करके आपकी गोपनीयता "
"सुनिश्चित करते हैं, जिसका अर्थ है कि आपकी व्यक्तिगत पहचान योग्य जानकारी "
"(जैसे आपका नाम या सटीक संपर्क विवरण) कभी भी बेची या साझा नहीं की जाएगी। आपकी"
" पहचान आपकी गुमनामता बनाए रखने के लिए एक अद्वितीय, यादृच्छिक संख्या से "
"प्रतिस्थापित की जाती है।"

#: .\podcasts\templates\podcasts\signup.html:215
#: .\podcasts\templates\socialaccount\signup.html:116
msgid "Data Security"
msgstr "डेटा सुरक्षा"

#: .\podcasts\templates\podcasts\signup.html:216
#: .\podcasts\templates\socialaccount\signup.html:117
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Muse Podcast, LLC employs industry-standard practices and technologies to "
"safeguard your personal information. However, no method of transmission over"
" the internet or electronic storage is 100%% secure, so while we strive to "
"protect your personal information, we cannot guarantee absolute security."
msgstr ""
"Muse Podcast, LLC employs industry-standard practices and technologies to "
"safeguard your personal information. However, no method of transmission over"
" the internet or electronic storage is 100%% secure, so while we strive to "
"protect your personal information, we cannot guarantee absolute security."

